{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliverance is an atmospheric psychological adventure game in which you play as a postman delivering letters to a deserted city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where each house conceals a piece of his own forgotten life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player explores a 3D hub street, moving between 2D rooms of different houses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >home to mysterious letter recipients: a musician, a girl, a soldier, a librarian, and an artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each letter represents a choice, and each choice changes the city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >revealing the postman's true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Key Gameplay Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83c\udfe0 6 unique houses \u2013 each representing a distinct story, emotion, and moral dilemma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\udc8c Letter mechanics: the player chooses which letter to deliver to the recipient based on the clues found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incorrect letter has dire consequences, while a correct one partially restores the city. \u2022 \ud83c\udf17 A Changing World: As you progress, the street comes to life or dies depending on the player's decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\udd0d Exploration: Find items, diaries, and clues that reveal the truth about the residents and the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f The Final House (House of the Devil): The story's climax, where the player confronts their own past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\udc80 Two endings: &quot;Acceptance&quot; or &quot;Oblivion&quot; \u2014 depend on all the choices made in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127950/extras/a98009551a846f8d6711d36d536d6313.avif?t=1763032143\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Art Style and Atmosphere:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A unique combination of 3D streets and 2D hand-drawn interiors,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >creating a dreamlike and unsettling effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A dark, melancholic sound design created using procedural music (Mubert).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The visual changes in the city reflect the protagonist's inner state \u2014 from devastation and rain to light and life.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127950?t=1763032143","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127950/0264a33cf040fc6ea9a9c7041a4882ac6a3d6cd9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763032143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127950/517bbad9068f4d4ee8578ff1e885a5f8664fe6e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763032143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127950/517bbad9068f4d4ee8578ff1e885a5f8664fe6e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763032143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliverance is an atmospheric psychological adventure game in which you play as a postman delivering letters to a deserted city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where each house conceals a piece of his own forgotten life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player explores a 3D hub street, moving between 2D rooms of different houses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >home to mysterious letter recipients: a musician, a girl, a soldier, a librarian, and an artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each letter represents a choice, and each choice changes the city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >revealing the postman's true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Key Gameplay Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83c\udfe0 6 unique houses \u2013 each representing a distinct story, emotion, and moral dilemma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\udc8c Letter mechanics: the player chooses which letter to deliver to the recipient based on the clues found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incorrect letter has dire consequences, while a correct one partially restores the city. \u2022 \ud83c\udf17 A Changing World: As you progress, the street comes to life or dies depending on the player's decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\udd0d Exploration: Find items, diaries, and clues that reveal the truth about the residents and the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f The Final House (House of the Devil): The story's climax, where the player confronts their own past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\udc80 Two endings: &quot;Acceptance&quot; or &quot;Oblivion&quot; \u2014 depend on all the choices made in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127950/extras/a98009551a846f8d6711d36d536d6313.avif?t=1763032143\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Art Style and Atmosphere:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A unique combination of 3D streets and 2D hand-drawn interiors,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >creating a dreamlike and unsettling effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A dark, melancholic sound design created using procedural music (Mubert).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The visual changes in the city reflect the protagonist's inner state \u2014 from devastation and rain to light and life.</p>","developers":["KUWA"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127950/b0e1ef0e6878845c11bcafc08020031f51df24d5/header.jpg?t=1763032143","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4127950/326197692/40b51a6a1ad21742ae8847b9b5d32ca613c255d7/1762205153/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762268696","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4127950/326197692/40b51a6a1ad21742ae8847b9b5d32ca613c255d7/1762205153/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762268696","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4127950/326197692/40b51a6a1ad21742ae8847b9b5d32ca613c255d7/1762205153/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762268696","id":257222248,"name":"Trailer Deliverance","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257222248/17b9f41d7f15de1f151a6fff3dfc821e9ceda806/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762268696"}],"name":"Deliverance","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Deliverance - $7.99 USD","packageid":1446447,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":799}],"title":"Buy Deliverance"}],"packages":[1446447],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit pr